発見した冒険商人なんじゃよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's a traveling merchant who discovered all sorts of channels and islands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……わし、前も同じ事いったよね？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Dear me. I've told you about this before, haven't I?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText></JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText/>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>To Do</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これが海運王チェンが世界中を
航海して完成させた地図じゃ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This is an atlas created by Chen, a shipper who surveyed the world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの男は、いくつもの海峡や島を
発見した冒険商人なんじゃよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>He's a traveling merchant who discovered all sorts of channels and islands.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56424</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……同じ事を言うのが
わしのシュミなんじゃよ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just get such a kick out of repeating myself!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>7</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェン大人は油断ならない男だぞ
会うつもりなら十分注意する事だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Papa Chen is a cunning man. If you want to meet him, you'd best prepare yourself mentally first.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほぅ、ソーマとは珍しいモノを
もっておるな!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lookie here, that's a rare looking Soma!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……ひとつ５００ガルドで
わしに売らんか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Care to sell it to me for 500 gald?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマとは珍しいモノを
もっておるなぁ!?</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Lookie here, that's a rare looking Soma!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ほとんどバレイア教会に
押収されて、民間ではめったに
見かけなくなっちまったんだよな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Most of them have been confiscated by the church, so I didn't expect to see a passing civilian with one.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマを売り払えば
いい暮らしができるぞ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you sell it to me, I'll give it a great home!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェンのひとり娘は
サンゴといって、女ながら
船長をやっておるのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chen's only child, Sango, is the captain of her own vessel despite being a woman.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>サンゴは、この辺りの海賊どもを
腕ずくで退治しちまった
とんでもないオテンバ娘なのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sango's been able to wipe out some nasty pirates with a swing of her arm. She's quite the rough lady.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェンの奴は九十九回も
娘に縁談を持ちこんでるんだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chen's brought 99 suitors to try and get his daughter married off...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>毎回、サンゴは
おムコ候補を蹴り飛ばして
断っちまうのだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Each and every time, Sango's knocked the suitor out cold and rejected him.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56516</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>困ったおじょうちゃんだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>She's quick the difficult lady.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>8</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あんたもチェンさんに
仕事をもらいに来たのかい？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Are you also here to talk to Chen about getting a job?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェン商会のバイトは
時給が高いのがミリョクだよなぁ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The Chen Corporation pays such a good hourly wage, I love it!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>2</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェン商会のバイト面接
……落とされちまったぜ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>My job application for the Chen Corporation got turned down...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>3</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>チェンめ……
俺を雇わなかった事を
後悔させてやる……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'll make him regret turning me down!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>こっそり商館の壁に
ラクガキしてやるぜーーーっ!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna draw graffiti ALL over the corporation's walls!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>4</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>もう一回、チェン商会に
面接を申し込んだんだが……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna try applying to work for the Chen Corporation again.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>5</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ソーマ使いどもが急に面会に
きたとかで、スルーされちまった!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I got totally ignored because of some Somatics who showed up!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>くっそぉ〜！
チェンとソーマ使いどもめぇー!!</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Damn you, Chen! Damn you, Somatics!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <SubId>6</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>やっとチェンに
雇ってもらったぜっ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Chen finally employed me!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>7</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>56608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>一生懸命がんばりまっす♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm gonna work my butt off!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>9</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>8</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>57116</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>これからは
『おばあちゃん』さ♪</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>From now on, I'll be just an “old lady”!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>10</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <SubId>1</SubId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
